# Redgate Software – Database DevOps Tools

> Redgate Software provides tools for database developers and DBAs to make managing databases and deploying database changes easier, safer, and more reliable. Products including Redgate Flyway and Redgate Monitor help teams automate software delivery for faster development, improve productivity and ensure optimal performance, and improve release quality while staying compliant and reducing risk.
>
> This file curates essential product, solution, and comparison pages to help LLMs and technical decision-makers understand Redgate's capabilities and use cases.

## Key Products

- [Redgate Flyway](https://www.red-gate.com/products/flyway/): Redgate Flyway enables automation of database deployment tasks, allowing version control of database code changes and repeatable and automated deployment processes, working with your existing toolset across over 50 database systems. 
- [Redgate Monitor](https://www.red-gate.com/products/redgate-monitor/): Monitor your database estate from wherever you are, ensuring performance and reliability. Provides database observability to mitigate potential risks with instant problem diagnosis and customizable alerting, for cloud, on-prem, and hybrid database environments.
- [SQL Toolbelt Essentials](https://www.red-gate.com/products/sql-toolbelt-essentials/): A collection of 11 SQL Server tools designed to reduce manual, time-consuming work and increase productivity.
- [SQL Prompt](https://www.red-gate.com/products/sql-prompt/): Increase SQL Server coding speed with IntelliSense-style code completion, one-click SQL formatting, customizable code snippets, SQL query history, and more.

